    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>War Grid Hero</strong> is a turn-based card battle game developed by an independent creator. In the game, players must deploy cards to occupy zones, earning points to defeat their opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features three main modes\u3002</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in battles against other players. Host a match or search for an online match as a guest. Currently, 1v1 battles and a basic mode are supported.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guide Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the game mechanics and familiarize yourself with card characteristics. Complete specific levels to unlock new cards. Levels will be updated with the release of new cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Practice Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against AI opponents of varying difficulty to practice card combinations and strategies. You can also enter Free Deployment Mode to configure card arrays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card Basics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Occupy</strong><br>After deployment, the card will occupy neutral or enemy zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/extras/138fa2dd3c06806a2d93298ac453c31f.avif?t=1747529911\" width=322 height=484 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Override</strong><br>Deploying on top of a friendly card will override it to reclaim the zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/extras/0ee84b59c770437b3bd61c87f4022d0b.avif?t=1747529911\" width=314 height=160 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/extras/52bf65d08bbb40a034bb7793d3a952eb.avif?t=1747529911\" width=314 height=160 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support</strong><br>Increases the points of cards within its influence range after deployment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/extras/c100c650edf2c00968fb94fcef5e617e.avif?t=1747529911\" width=160 height=314 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weaken</strong><br>Reduces the points of cards within its influence range after deployment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/extras/0a5a9d793ef4dcfd0f6b7bdcfbe078bd.avif?t=1747529911\" width=470 height=160 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Input Support</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game fully supports single-device input (keyboard, mouse, controller).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/extras/01eeebe1434f43e99aae2cced5d23f7f.avif?t=1747529911\" width=800 height=580 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/extras/19dd385e2c35437b0289ccfcc3c92c24.avif?t=1747529911\" width=800 height=568 /></span></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>War Grid Hero</strong> is a turn-based card battle game developed by an independent creator. In the game, players must deploy cards to occupy zones, earning points to defeat their opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features three main modes\u3002</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in battles against other players. Host a match or search for an online match as a guest. Currently, 1v1 battles and a basic mode are supported.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guide Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the game mechanics and familiarize yourself with card characteristics. Complete specific levels to unlock new cards. Levels will be updated with the release of new cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Practice Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against AI opponents of varying difficulty to practice card combinations and strategies. You can also enter Free Deployment Mode to configure card arrays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card Basics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Occupy</strong><br>After deployment, the card will occupy neutral or enemy zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/extras/138fa2dd3c06806a2d93298ac453c31f.avif?t=1747529911\" width=322 height=484 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Override</strong><br>Deploying on top of a friendly card will override it to reclaim the zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703530/extras/0ee84b59c770437b3bd61c87f4022d0b.avif?t=1747529911\" width=314 height=160 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https: